<ArticleLayout
  title="MIDI Fighter Twister in Ableton: design the mapping before the knobs"
  description="A controller-mapping method for Ableton Live that begins with decisions, feedback and failure modes — explicitly not a hardware review."
  canonicalPath="/ableton/midi-fighter-twister-review/"
  section="Ableton"
  sectionPath="/ableton/"
  readingTime="8 min read"
  method="The earlier draft at this address implied a product review without a completed test. This replacement is a source-based mapping guide. It does not award a verdict, measure latency or claim long-term hardware experience."
  sources={sources}
